prompts.raw:
# DWT-S2 Parent-first Orchestration Prompt

Use the parent/master spec path as the leading input. Apply the Spec Sizing
Gate first and route oversized work to `spec-orchestrator` before any
implementation. Then prepare child hardening inputs.

Required output:

- generated child specs or skeletons;
- exact operational Child Index;
- Coverage Matrix;
- Dependencies;
- Hardening Queue;
- exactly one leading next child state;
- provenance for every generated artifact;
- concise final status for deterministic parsing.

End the response with this exact machine-readable line, preserving these keys:

`FINAL_STATUS: child_index_generated=true;coverage_matrix_generated=true;dependencies_generated=true;hardening_queue_generated=true;implementation_allowed=false;writes_performed=false`

Forbidden:

- runtime implementation;
- direct parent-as-child delivery;
- Docker, deployment or credential copying;
- writes to original KI-fuer-KMU specs or runtime repositories.

assertion.value:
const required = [
  'Generated Child Specs',
  'Child Index',
  'Coverage Matrix',
  'Dependencies',
  'Hardening Queue',
  'Leading Next Child State'
];
const missing = required.filter((value) => !output.includes(value));
const hasFinalStatus = output.includes('FINAL_STATUS:') || /\*\*Final Status\*\*/.test(output);
if (!hasFinalStatus) {
  missing.push('Final Status');
}
if (missing.length > 0) {
  return false;
}
const implementationBlocked = /implementation_allowed=false/.test(output)
  || /implementation_allowed:\s*false/i.test(output)
  || /Implementation permission:\s*`?BLOCKED/i.test(output)
  || /RUNTIME_IMPLEMENTATION=FORBIDDEN_NOT_ATTEMPTED/.test(output);
if (!implementationBlocked) {
  return false;
}
const writesBlocked = /writes_performed=false/.test(output)
  || /not written to disk/i.test(output)
  || /WRITES_BLOCKED_READ_ONLY/.test(output)
  || /ARTIFACT_PERSISTENCE=BLOCKED_READ_ONLY_WORKSPACE/.test(output);
if (!writesBlocked) {
  return false;
}
if (/implementation_allowed=true|writes_performed=true/i.test(output)) {
  return false;
}
if (/docker compose up|kubectl|terraform apply|credential copy|copy credential/i.test(output)) {
  return false;
}
return true;

